      "text": "(controller\n    sqrt-loop\n        (assign x (op read))\n        (assign g (const 1.0))\n    test-ge\n        (test (op ge?) (reg g) (reg x)))\n        (branch (label sqrt-done))\n        (assign g (op ig) (reg g)) (reg x))\n        (goto (label test-ge))\n    sqrt-done\n        (perform (op print) (reg g))\n        (goto (label sqrt-loop)))\n        ",
